<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78641" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπόμπ-ττω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπομπ-πρήσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do</i> a thing <i>beside</i> or
				<i>beyond </i>the main purpose, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.45
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε πολυπραγμονῶν οὔτε
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				76.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>help in doing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδενὸς ἄλλου παραπράξαντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					261
				</span></i>
			 (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>act unjustly</i>, esp. <i>exact money illegally</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Agis</u>
				16
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				238.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
